  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 102.05 \"Parolee\" means any inmate sentenced to the New Hampshire state prison system who is released from the prison system by the adult parole board.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Par 102) #5685, eff 8-16-93; ss by #7070, INTERIM, eff 8-12-99, EXPIRES: 12-10-99; ss and moved by #7148, eff 12-7-99 (formerly Par 101.05); ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17 (from Par 102.04)",
